### Thread 1 (BLOCKING): `provider.githubApi` doesn't exist
Add a `listOpenPrsLive()` method to the smProvider facade that bypasses the ioCache (fresh `github_list_prs` call, and refresh the cache entry so subsequent reads agree), and change githubSource to use it. Guard: `typeof provider.listOpenPrsLive === 'function'`.

