- githubProvider's CC unchanged (property addition only, same as other entries — the facade object lists listOpenPrs/listOpenPrs already as properties referencing nested functions; I added a NESTED FUNCTION DECLARATION inside the body plus a property. The other methods are declared as nested functions in the body too. So declaration style matches... yet CC grew.)

